   3.975188304058094*^9}, {3.975282949462543*^9, 
   3.975282951123187*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"58da1e13-2f5a-4162-9018-\
e796adeb56e7"],

Cell["\<\
By following this exact procedure\[LongDash]identifying the symmetries, \
finding the singular Hessians, and enforcing the resulting constraints\
\[LongDash]we derive the quantum-theoretical forces of nature, except for \
gravitation:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.975119724717957*^9, {3.975185863334693*^9, 3.975185960766884*^9}, {
   3.975186335204997*^9, 3.975186378447083*^9}, {3.975186481658581*^9, 
   3.975186523869499*^9}, {3.975186557291993*^9, 3.975186598287777*^9}, {
   3.9751867212544107`*^9, 3.9751868361873503`*^9}, {3.9751868702450438`*^9, 
